"prepare": 3,
"recover": 10,
"release": 6
})
effect_parts = PackedStringArray("Effect5", "Magic2", "Shadow", "Slash1", "Slash2", "Magic1", "Magic3")
notes = "Winds an arm overhead, brings the upper body and hand down through a chopping stroke, then recovers.
Effect4: Broader bright contour/afterimage follows the moving body and limbs.
Effect5: Tighter, finer patterned body contour follows the action with less surrounding spread.
Magic1: Fine flickering particles attached to the hands; sparse, airy detail. This sheet follows overhead chop.
Magic2: Broader smoky/ribbon-like wisps around moving hands; more trailing energy. This sheet follows overhead chop.
Magic3: Compact, bright hand glows with shorter surrounding flecks. This sheet follows overhead chop."

