})
effect_parts = PackedStringArray("Effect1", "Effect2", "Effect3", "Effect4", "Effect5", "Magic2", "Shadow", "Slash1", "Slash2", "Magic1", "Magic3")
notes = "Holds an arm high, sinks into a deep knee bend, and drives the hand/body down toward the ground.
Effect1: Fine particles precede a foot-centered circle that expands into a broad flashing ring after the downward motion.
Effect2: Several radii of tall upward spikes surround the figure through the overhead-to-ground motion.
Effect3: Energy descends toward the body, then a segmented radial burst spreads from the feet.
Effect4: Broader bright contour/afterimage follows the moving body and limbs.
Effect5: Tighter, finer patterned body contour follows the action with less surrounding spread.
Magic1: Fine flickering particles attached to the hands; sparse, airy detail. This sheet follows overhead into ground.
Magic2: Broader smoky/ribbon-like wisps around moving hands; more trailing energy. This sheet follows overhead into ground.
Magic3: Compact, bright hand glows with shorter surrounding flecks. This sheet follows overhead into ground."

