notes = "Keeps a mostly upright stance, brings a hand forward and extends it toward the target, then retracts.
Effect1: Small directional flare/ring at the forward/off-hand region; it follows the pointing sequence and disappears.
Effect2: Two large bright bodies orbit around the caster with long curved trails, then fade.
Effect3: A large directional skull grows in front of/over the figure and dissolves.
Effect4: Broader bright contour/afterimage follows the moving body and limbs.
Effect5: Tighter, finer patterned body contour follows the action with less surrounding spread.
Magic1: Fine flickering particles attached to the hands; sparse, airy detail. This sheet follows pointed hand release.
Magic2: Broader smoky/ribbon-like wisps around moving hands; more trailing energy. This sheet follows pointed hand release.
Magic3: Compact, bright hand glows with shorter surrounding flecks. This sheet follows pointed hand release."

