notes = "Leans into a low forward lunge with a punching/thrusting arm motion, then straightens and recovers.
Effect1: Brief narrow directional flare at the thrusting hand during the low lunge.
Effect2: A narrower group of tall spikes is strong during preparation, then mostly fades to scattered sparks around the thrust/recovery.
Effect3: Descending energy in preparation leads to a segmented foot-centered radial burst after the thrust.
Effect4: Broader bright contour/afterimage follows the moving body and limbs.
Effect5: Tighter, finer patterned body contour follows the action with less surrounding spread.
Magic1: Fine flickering particles attached to the hands; sparse, airy detail. This sheet follows low forward thrust.
Magic2: Broader smoky/ribbon-like wisps around moving hands; more trailing energy. This sheet follows low forward thrust.
Magic3: Compact, bright hand glows with shorter surrounding flecks. This sheet follows low forward thrust."

