notes = "Raises/gathers the hands, dips through the knees with arms forward, then rises and opens the arms upward/outward before settling.
Effect1: A small ring forms at the feet, then becomes a broad multi-line ground circle and upward radial flare as the arms open.
Effect2: Loose concentric particle spirals surround preparation; a field of upward energy spikes appears around the arm-open phase.
Effect3: A wide ring of small particles builds, followed by a relatively narrow vertical cage/column around the rising body.
Effect4: Broader bright contour/afterimage follows the moving body and limbs.
Effect5: Tighter, finer patterned body contour follows the action with less surrounding spread.
Magic1: Fine flickering particles attached to the hands; sparse, airy detail. This sheet follows gather, dip and open.
Magic2: Broader smoky/ribbon-like wisps around moving hands; more trailing energy. This sheet follows gather, dip and open.
Magic3: Compact, bright hand glows with shorter surrounding flecks. This sheet follows gather, dip and open."

